\* All TLC check configs for AntflyCdcCutover.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStreamBoundaryDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCheckpointAhead = FALSE
    BuggyResumeReplaysCheckpoint = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    NoDuplicateDelivery
    CheckpointOnlyCoversDelivered
    StreamStartsAfterSnapshotHighWater
    ResumeCursorStartsAtCheckpoint
    Safety

==== BadBoundaryDuplicate
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyCdcCutover.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStreamBoundaryDuplicate = TRUE
    BuggyCheckpointAhead = FALSE
    BuggyResumeReplaysCheckpoint = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    NoDuplicateDelivery

==== BadCheckpointAhead
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyCdcCutover.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStreamBoundaryDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCheckpointAhead = TRUE
    BuggyResumeReplaysCheckpoint = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CheckpointOnlyCoversDelivered

==== BadResumeReplay
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyCdcCutover.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where resume reconstructs the snapshot/stream cursor behind
\* the durable checkpoint and can replay an already delivered row.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStreamBoundaryDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCheckpointAhead = FALSE
    BuggyResumeReplaysCheckpoint = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    ResumeCursorStartsAtCheckpoint

==== BadStreamBeforeSnapshotComplete
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyCdcCutover.tla.
\* Reuses the checkpoint-ahead mutant: a crash after the premature checkpoint
\* resumes directly into stream phase with undelivered snapshot rows, pinned to
\* the snapshot-completeness-at-stream-start invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStreamBoundaryDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCheckpointAhead = TRUE
    BuggyResumeReplaysCheckpoint = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    StreamStartsAfterSnapshotHighWater
